  <h2 id="s13">13. Jurisdiction and applicable law</h2>
  <p>This Privacy Policy is governed by Italian law and EU Regulation 2016/679 (GDPR). For disputes the consumer's forum applies under Italian Legislative Decree 206/2005 (Consumer Code).</p>
  <p>For users outside the EU, Italian law and GDPR apply to personal data processing, except where stricter national consumer-protection rules apply.</p>
</LegalLayout>
